    mcq1: ["What does 2 Peter 3:9 say about why the Lord seems to delay?", ["He is patient, not wishing that any should perish", "He has forgotten", "He is unable", "He changed his mind"], 0, "He is patient and wants all to reach repentance."],
    mcq2: ["What are we waiting for according to 2 Peter 3:13?", ["New heavens and a new earth in which righteousness dwells", "A return to the old creation", "An escape into space", "A new temple only"], 0, "Peter points to new heavens and a new earth."],
