    takeHome: "Read Revelation 20:11-15, 2 Corinthians 5:1-11, Romans 14:1-12 and John 5:19-29. Write a paragraph on how the final judgment should affect the way we live and speak of Christ. Pray for those who do not believe.",
    prayer: "Worship Christ the righteous judge. Thank him for taking our place. Pray for the unsaved and ask for courage to tell them of his mercy.",
